Typical overrides:

{% if is_fespalier_preset %}
An app passes its transport chain once; the generated client sends through it:

```dart
final container = ProviderContainer(
  overrides: [
    {{ provider_prefix }}TransportProvider.overrideWith(
      (ref) => SessionTransport(WriteGuardTransport(HttpClientTransport(client)), credentials),
    ),
    {{ provider_prefix }}BaseUriProvider.overrideWithValue(Uri.parse('https://api.example.com')),
{% if not is_rpc %}
    {{ provider_prefix }}BasePathProvider.overrideWith((ref) => '{{ base_path_literal }}'),
{% endif %}
  ],
);
```
{% else %}
```dart
final container = ProviderContainer(
